<title>JAPAN: Tostem Viva -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tostem Viva -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
